{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q425198","formula":"C₁₅H₁₈N₂O","hill":"C15H18N2O","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":18.0,"N":2.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"Huperzine A","ru":"Huperzine A"},"descriptions":{"en":"Huperzine A, a Lycopodium alkaloid, was first isolated in 1983 from Huperzia serrata, a plant used in Chinese folk medicine. Huperzine A also exists in other Huperzia species, including H. elmeri, H. carinat, and H. aqualupian with varying quantities. Huperzine A has been investigated as a treatment for neurological conditions such as Alzheimer's disease, but a 2013 meta-analysis of those studies concluded that they were of poor methodological quality and the findings should be interpreted with caution.","ru":"Гуперзин А представляет собой природное сесквитерпеновое алкалоидное соединение, содержащееся в растении Баране́ц пильчатый (лат. Huperzia serrata) рода Баране́ц, известное в китайской народной медицине. Гуперзин А также встречается в других пищевых видах рода Баране́ц, включая H. elmeri, H. carinata и H. aqualupiana."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":854026,"mass":242.32,"charge":0,"smiles":"C/C=C/1\\[C@@H]2CC3=C([C@]1(CC(=C2)C)N)C=CC(=O)N3","inchikey":"ZRJBHWIHUMBLCN-YQEJDHNASA-N","iupac":"(1R,9R,13E)-1-amino-13-ethylidene-11-methyl-6-azatricyclo[7.3.1.02,7]trideca-2(7),3,10-trien-5-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"854026","atoms":36,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":4.564,"y":-0.314,"z":-0.712,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.83,"y":-0.451,"z":2.519,"el":"N"},{"x":2.303,"y":-0.559,"z":-1.107,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.742,"y":-0.004,"z":1.115,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.48,"y":-0.404,"z":-1.251,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.664,"y":-0.816,"z":0.196,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.243,"y":1.474,"z":1.036,"el":"C"},{"x":0.71,"y":-0.08,"z":0.587,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.067,"y":-0.841,"z":-1.